From e71c7e0d01ec657fe1d48e9b3f169ef8ab10c5ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Guan Xuetao <gxt@pku.edu.cn>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 00:58:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] DADAO: Add instruction format classes and 178 M1 instruction
 defs

Add DADAOInstrFormats.td with 9 M1 format classes (rrrr/rrri/rrii/riii/iiii/rwii/orrr/orri/oiii).
Add DADAOInstrInfo.td with 178 M1 instruction defs auto-generated from
contracts/opcodes.yaml by tools/llvm/generate_instrinfo.py.

Operand classes: imms12/immu12/imms18/immu18/immu6/imms24/immu24/immu16/wydepos
with DecoderMethod annotations for LLVM-008t.

Add DADAOInstrInfo.{h,cpp} to include DADAOGenInstrInfo.inc.

No AsmParser/Disassembler implementation. All patterns empty [].
excluded_m1 (78) instructions are NOT defined.
---
 llvm/lib/Target/DADAO/CMakeLists.txt       |    8 +-
 llvm/lib/Target/DADAO/DADAO.td             |   19 +-
 llvm/lib/Target/DADAO/DADAOInstrFormats.td |  221 +++
 llvm/lib/Target/DADAO/DADAOInstrInfo.cpp   |   31 +
 llvm/lib/Target/DADAO/DADAOInstrInfo.h     |   41 +
 llvm/lib/Target/DADAO/DADAOInstrInfo.td    | 1471 ++++++++++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 1787 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 llvm/lib/Target/DADAO/DADAOInstrFormats.td
 create mode 100644 llvm/lib/Target/DADAO/DADAOInstrInfo.cpp
 create mode 100644 llvm/lib/Target/DADAO/DADAOInstrInfo.h
 create mode 100644 llvm/lib/Target/DADAO/DADAOInstrInfo.td

